      "id": "A3M2-T800-KELTHUZAD",
      "scene": "TRANSMISSIONS.Ascension.Transmission Boss Finale Phase2 End Q",
      "speaker": "克尔苏加德",
      "text": "完成了！不消片刻，幽暗城就会不复存在！",
